#: flowview_devices.php
msgid "There are two support collection methods, the first utilizes the legacy flow-tools binaries and the second leverages Cacti's own PHP based flow stream server."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà ìkójọpọ̀ àtìlẹ́yìn méjì ló wà, èyí àkọ́kọ́ ń lo àwọn fáìlì aláìgbàlódé flow-tools àti èyí kejì ń lo olùpèsè ìṣàn flow tí a kọ́ lórí PHP ti Cacti fúnra rẹ̀."

#: flowview_devices.php
msgid "Bind to address"
