#: flowview_filters.php
msgid "Materialization pre-computes the results of a Filter for each flow partition, with NAT on and off, and stores them in the Parallel Query cache, so reports over older data open quickly.  New partitions are materialized automatically once they stop receiving flows.  Required means partitions that have rotated are not materialized yet, Running means a materialization is in progress, and Up to date means every rotated partition is materialized.  Running: N is how many queries of the Filter are working now.  The partition still receiving flows is not materialized, so it does not count."
msgstr "Ìmúṣẹ máa ń ṣírò àwọn èsì Àlẹ̀mọ́ tẹ́lẹ̀ fún apá ìṣàn kọ̀ọ̀kan, pẹ̀lú NAT ní ṣíṣí àti pípa, ó sì ń fi wọ́n pamọ́ sínú àpótí ìpamọ́ Parallel Query, kí àwọn ìjábọ̀ lórí dátà àtijọ́ lè ṣí kíákíá.  Àwọn apá tuntun máa ń gba ìmúṣẹ fúnra wọn nígbà tí wọ́n bá dáwọ́ gbígba ìṣàn dúró.  Dandan túmọ̀ sí pé àwọn apá tí ó ti yí padà kò tíì gba ìmúṣẹ, Ń ṣiṣẹ́ túmọ̀ sí pé ìmúṣẹ kan ń lọ lọ́wọ́, àti Títí di òní túmọ̀ sí pé gbogbo apá tí ó ti yí padà ni ó ti gba ìmúṣẹ.  Ń ṣiṣẹ́: N ni iye àwọn ìbéèrè Àlẹ̀mọ́ tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ báyìí.  Apá tí ó ṣì ń gba ìṣàn kò gba ìmúṣẹ, nítorí náà kò sí lára ìṣirò."

