#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how parallel FlowView queries are executed.  The Legacy PHP Runner forks the flowview_runner.php process per query and shard.  The FlowView Query Service dispatches the same map-reduce work to a long-running Go service over localhost, avoiding per-query process startup and database polling latency.  Requires the flowview-query service (see plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) to be installed and running."
msgstr "Yan bí a ṣe ń ṣiṣẹ́ àwọn ìbéèrè FlowView ní ìṣọ̀kan. Olùṣiṣẹ́ PHP Àtijọ́ ń pín ìlànà flowview_runner.php fún ìbéèrè àti shard kọ̀ọ̀kan. Iṣẹ́ Ìbéèrè FlowView ń rán iṣẹ́ map-reduce kan náà sí iṣẹ́ Go tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ pẹ́ lórí localhost, tí ó ń yẹra fún ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ìlànà fún ìbéèrè kọ̀ọ̀kan àti ìdádúró ìṣàyẹ̀wò ibi ìpamọ́ dátà. Ó nílò kí iṣẹ́ flowview-query (wo plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) jẹ́ fífi sórí ẹ̀rọ kí ó sì máa ṣiṣẹ́."

#: setup.php
msgid "Legacy PHP Runner"
msgstr "Olùṣiṣẹ́ PHP Àtijọ́"

#: setup.php
msgid "FlowView Query Service"
msgstr "Iṣẹ́ Ìbéèrè FlowView"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service URL"
msgstr "URL Ìṣẹ́ Ìbéèrè"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "URL Ìpìlẹ̀ ti Iṣẹ́ Ìbéèrè FlowView, fún àpẹẹrẹ http://127.0.0.1:8699. Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo láti ṣàwárí ibùdó ìgbà díẹ̀ lọ́nà àdáṣe láti inú fáìlì ibùdó iṣẹ́ náà."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Port File"
msgstr "Fáìlì Ibùdó Ìṣẹ́ Ìbéèrè"

#: setup.php
msgid "Path to the port file the FlowView Query Service writes its bound address to.  Used to discover the service endpoint when the Query Service URL above is blank."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí fáìlì pọ́ọ̀tì tí Iṣẹ́ Ìbéèrè FlowView ń kọ àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì rẹ̀ sí.  A ń lò ó láti ṣàwárí ibi ìpẹ̀kun iṣẹ́ nígbà tí URL Iṣẹ́ Ìbéèrè lókè bá ṣófo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Token"
msgstr "Àmì-ẹ̀rí Ìṣẹ́ Ìbéèrè"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional shared secret.  When set, Cacti sends it to the FlowView Query Service as an \"Authorization: Bearer\" header and the service rejects any state-changing request that does not present the same token.  Set the matching value in the service's config file (auth_token) or the FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN environment variable.  Recommended whenever the service is reachable by anything other than trusted local processes."
msgstr "Àṣírí àjọpín àṣàyàn.  Nígbà tí a bá ṣètò rẹ̀, Cacti máa ń fi ránṣẹ́ sí Iṣẹ́ Ìbéèrè FlowView gẹ́gẹ́ bí àkọlé \"Authorization: Bearer\", iṣẹ́ náà yóò sì kọ̀ èyíkéyìí ìbéèrè tí ó ń yí ipò padà tí kò bá gbé tókìnì kan náà kalẹ̀.  Ṣètò iye tí ó bá a mu nínú fáìlì ètò iṣẹ́ náà (auth_token) tàbí onírúurú àyíká FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN.  A gbani nímọ̀ràn rẹ̀ nígbàkígbà tí ohunkóhun mìíràn yàtọ̀ sí àwọn ìlànà àdúgbò tí a fọkàn tán bá lè dé ọ̀dọ̀ iṣẹ́ náà."

#: setup.php
msgid "Max Concurrent Threads"
msgstr "Àwọn Òwú Ìṣiṣẹ́ Lẹ́ẹ̀kan Náà Tó Pọ̀ Jù Lọ"

#: setup.php
msgid "The maximum number of threads that will be dispatched to run the FlowView queries.  Note that you can have at most 1 thread per database partition, and you should be careful not to overload your database server with having too many concurrent threads running."
msgstr "Iye tó pọ̀ jùlọ ti àwọn okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ (threads) tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́ láti ṣe àwọn ìbéèrè FlowView.  Kíyèsí pé o lè ní okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ 1 ní púpọ̀ jùlọ fún ìpín ibi ìpamọ́ dátà kọ̀ọ̀kan, ó sì yẹ kí o ṣọ́ra kí o má baà fi ẹrù pa sẹ́fà ibi ìpamọ́ dátà rẹ pẹ̀lú àwọn okùn ìṣiṣẹ́ púpọ̀ tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà."

#: setup.php
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Àìṣiṣẹ́"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Threads"
msgstr "Àwọn Òwú %d"

#: setup.php
msgid "Maximum Run Time"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìṣiṣẹ́ Tó Pọ̀ Jù Lọ"

#: setup.php
msgid "If the Parallel Query does not finish in this time, exit."
msgstr "Tí Ìbéèrè Alábàápín kò bá parí láàárín àkókò yìí, jáde."

#: setup.php
msgid "Cached Data Time to Live"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìwà Láàyè Dátà Tí A Fi Pamọ́"

#: setup.php
msgid "How long should FlowView hold onto Cached Query results before purging them?"
msgstr "Ìgbà wo ni FlowView yẹ kí ó di àwọn èsì Ìbéèrè Tí A Fi Pamọ́ mú kí ó tó pa wọ́n rẹ́?"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Hours"
msgstr "Wákàtí %d"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "Ọjọ́ %d"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "Ọjọ́ %d"

#: setup.php
msgid "MaxScale Sharding"
msgstr "Pípín MaxScale"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is only required if your Cacti System's Flowview Database connection is not already using a MaxScale enabled Read-Write Split port."
msgstr "Èyí pọndandan nìkan tí ìsopọ̀ Ibi-ìpamọ́ Dátà Flowview ti Ètò Cacti rẹ kò bá ti ń lo ibùdó Read-Write Split tí MaxScale mú ṣiṣẹ́ tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: setup.php
msgid "Leverage MaxScale to Distribute Query Shards"
msgstr "Lo MaxScale láti Pín Àwọn Àkójọpọ̀ Ìbéèrè Káàkiri"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you have multiple service acting as slaves for MaxScale, you can increase the speed of querying by distributing the parallel queries to multiple MariaDB backend servers."
msgstr "Tí o bá ní ọ̀pọ̀ iṣẹ́ tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ẹrú (slaves) fún MaxScale, o lè mú kí iyára ìbéèrè pọ̀ sí i nípa pínpín àwọn ìbéèrè alábàápín sí ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ olùpèsè MariaDB abẹ́lẹ̀."

#: setup.php
msgid "MaxScale Read-Write Split Port"
msgstr "Ibùdó Pípín Kíkà-Kíkọ MaxScale"

#: setup.php
msgid "This should be the port of the Read-Write-Split-Service (readwrite) service and router."
msgstr "Èyí yẹ kí ó jẹ́ ibùdókọ̀ ti iṣẹ́ Read-Write-Split-Service (readwrite) àti olùtọ́sọ́nà."

